  <section class="proposition">
    <div class="proposition-grid wrap">
      <article class="proposition-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">A distributed documentary corpus</p>
        <p class="statement">Galápagos history is scattered across archives, libraries, museums, private collections and communities around the world.</p>
        <p>Galapagensis identifies and connects those fragments.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="proposition-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Documented relationships</p>
        <p class="statement">Sources rarely stand alone.</p>
        <p>Galapagensis traces the connections among people, places, expeditions, objects, memories and repositories to reconstruct histories dispersed across the record.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

